    "detailed_description": "For more game content, please follow the official website of Chaoliang Zhanji and visit the &quot;Wuhun Guoguang&quot; section to fully understand. We warmly welcome players to come<br />\r\nGame introduction:<br />\r\n1. This is a 3D ARPG third person action adventure game developed with Journey to the West as the main game background<br />\r\n2. Please do not have high expectations for this game. This is just my first independent game project and it has been updated based on the Unreal 5 engine for development<br />\r\n3. Many cases and demonstrations about Chinese kung fu have been added to Wukong, inheriting the excellent traditional Chinese culture<br />\r\n4. The development and production of this game are twofold: firstly, to deepen the development of technical skills; secondly, to spread some of China's excellent traditional cultural history through the game<br />\r\n5. This game belongs to the author's personal efforts, and the total deposit for listing the game is $100. We do not want any cheating or abuse of the game for reverse engineering input or output. Once discovered, legal responsibility will be pursued<br />\r\nFinally, thank you very much for supporting and playing my game.",
